rkets for similar assets and liabilities, or other inputs that are observable for the asset or liability, either directly or indirectly, for substantially the full term of the financial instrument.","context":"Level 1 – Quoted prices in active markets for identical assets and liabilities.","section":"Segment reporting","block":282,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-037914","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-08-14","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0002011458","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011458/000149315226037914/ex99-2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/46ea7b4405496fa75ef5b65282048abb475d4c1ed2b08f8bad96510d1152995d.bin","sha256":"46ea7b4405496fa75ef5b65282048abb475d4c1ed2b08f8bad96510d1152995d"}},{"id":"99b279d4f30c4e36d6600e51a33abe84b442f28de404ee13f8c958be320860d6","quote":"Level 3 – Unobservable inputs that are supported by little or no market activity and that are significant to the fair value of the assets and liabilities. This includes certain pricing models, discounted cash flow methodologies and similar techniques that use significant unobservable inputs.","context":"Level 2 – Quoted prices in active markets for similar assets and liabilities, or other inputs that are observable for the asset or liability, either directly or indirectly, for substantially the full term of the financial instrument.","section":"Segment reporting","block":283,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-037914","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-08-14","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0002011458","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011458/000149315226037914/ex99-2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/46ea7b4405496fa75ef5b65282048abb475d4c1ed2b08f8bad96510d1152995d.bin","sha256":"46ea7b4405496fa75ef5b65282048abb475d4c1ed2b08f8bad96510d1152995d"}},{"id":"b29793ab0cbf5a83da582d